(5, 'Empty', 'Time and a Half Calculator', 'Time and a Half Calculator', 'time-and-a-half-calculator', 'Time and a Half Calculator', 'Empty', 'Empty', 'Time and a Half Calculator', 'The time and a half calculator calculates the overtime pay for employees working more than their standard hours with 100% accuracy.', '{\"tool_desc\":\"Time and half calculator calculate the total earnings, standard hours pay, yearly pay, and overtime salary based on your job hours and the rate per hour you enter.\",\"time_des\":\"note:\",\"feedback_text\":\"Give us your feedback\",\"resl\":\"Result\",\"calc\":\"Calculate\",\"re_calc\":\"Re Calculate\",\"1\":\"Pay rate choice\",\"2\":\"Standard hourly pay rate\",\"3\":\"Hours worked per standard day\",\"4\":\"Hours worked at time and a half\",\"5\":\"Standard hours worked\",\"6\":\"Standard hourly rate\",\"7\":\"Time and a half rate\",\"8\":\"Time and a half pay\",\"9\":\"Standard pay\",\"10\":\"Total money earned\",\"11\":\"Semi Monthly\",\"12\":\"Monthly\",\"13\":\"Total Earning\",\"14\":\"Standard Hours Pay\",\"15\":\"Regular Pay Per Year\",\"16\":\"Overtime Pay per Year\",\"17\":\"Total Pay Per Year\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"contact-us\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"content-disc\":\"Content Disclaimer\",\"terms-n-condition\":\"Terms And Conditions\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"footer-desc\":\"Manage your time like a pro! The time calculator is a free online resource that is ready to help                         individuals seeking some assistance to manage their time for planning events and other tasks.\",\"Follow-Us\":\"Follow Us\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"related\":\"Related Tools\",\"rating\":\"Rating & Review\",\"Votes\":\"Votes\",\"feedback-experience\":\"How Was Your Calculator Experience?\",\"email\":\"Email\",\"feedback-msg\":\"How Can We Impove It?\",\"feedback-Close\":\"Close\",\"feedback-Submit\":\"Submit\",\"toc\":\"Table of Content\",\"opt\":\"Optional\"}', 'Time and a Half Calculator', 0, '{\"0\":\"Time Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-calculator\",\"1\":\"khali\",\"2\":\"Time Duration Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-duration-calculator\",\"more\":[{\"cal_link\":\"time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-to-decimal\",\"cal_title\":\"Time to Decimal\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-duration-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Duration Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-span-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Span Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-and-a-half-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time and a Half Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-dilation-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Dilation Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"de\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Zeitrechner\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"fr\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calcul Heure\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"es\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tiempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ru\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u041a\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c\\u043a\\u0443\\u043b\\u044f\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440 \\u0412\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ar\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u062d\\u0633\\u0627\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0642\\u062a\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"pt\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ja\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u6642\\u9593\\u8a08\\u7b97\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"}]}', 'Timedate', '0', 1, '', '', 'Calculator', 'Be Happy', 0, 1, 'admin', 'admin', 0, '{\"by-default\":\"What Is Time and a Half Pay?\\r\\nHow Do I Calculate My Overtime Pay?\\r\\nExample:\\r\\nWhat Is Time and a Half of $22?\\r\\nIs Overtime Pay Always Calculated At Time-and-a-Half?\",\"what-is-time-and-a-half-pay\":\"What Is Time and a Half Pay?\\r\",\"how-do-i-calculate-my-overtime-pay\":\"How Do I Calculate My Overtime Pay?\\r\",\"example\":\"Example:\\r\",\"what-is-time-and-a-half-of-22\":\"What Is Time and a Half of $22?\\r\",\"is-overtime-pay-always-calculated-at-time-and-a-half\":\"Is Overtime Pay Always Calculated At Time-and-a-Half?\"}', '1', '<h2>TIME AND A HALF CALCULATOR</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Time and a Half Calculator Illustration\" src=\"https://api.thetime-calculator.com/images/uploaded_1767890030283.svg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Trying to figure out your overtime pay can make your head spin. That&#39;s why a <strong>Time and a Half Calculator</strong> is so useful. It takes the guesswork out of the process, whether you&#39;re an employee or an employer. Basically, &quot;<strong>time and a half</strong>&quot; means you get paid <strong>one and a half times your usual hourly rate</strong> for any overtime you work. If your job requires overtime pay&mdash;thanks to law or company rules&mdash;this tool is a lifesaver.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Doing the math yourself is a pain, and honestly, it&#39;s easy to slip up, especially when your overtime hours are all over the map. With this calculator, you just plug in your <strong>regular hourly wage</strong> and how many <strong>overtime hours</strong> you worked. That&#39;s it. The calculator handles the rest and gives you a clear, quick answer every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Time and a Half Calculation Breakdown\" src=\"https://api.thetime-calculator.com/images/uploaded_1767890049441.svg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHAT DOES TIME AND A HALF REALLY MEAN?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Time and a half</strong> is just a fancy way of saying you get paid <strong>1.5 times your usual hourly rate</strong> for overtime. So, if you make $10 an hour, your overtime rate jumps to $15 for each extra hour you work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most of the time, you start earning this rate once you work more than the usual hours in a week&mdash;typically anything over <strong>40 hours</strong>. That said, this can shift if local laws or your company&#39;s policies are different.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, how does a time and a half calculator actually work? It&#39;s simple. Take your <strong>normal hourly pay</strong>, bump it up by 1.5, and that&#39;s your <strong>overtime rate</strong>. Then, just multiply that overtime rate by however many extra hours you worked.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For example, say you make $20 an hour and you put in 8 overtime hours. You&#39;d take $20, multiply by 1.5, and get $30 for each overtime hour. Multiply $30 by 8, and there it is&mdash;$240 in overtime pay.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHY BOTHER WITH A TIME AND A HALF CALCULATOR?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Honestly, it just makes life easier. You get <strong>accurate numbers</strong>, save time, and stay on the right side of payroll rules. It cuts out the guesswork for both employees and payroll teams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It also helps you double-check your own pay, so you know exactly how your overtime wage is figured out. That kind of clarity goes a long way toward building trust between workers and employers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHEN DO PEOPLE USE A TIME AND A HALF CALCULATOR?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Payroll departments</strong> use it all the time to make sure everyone gets paid correctly for extra hours. <strong>Employees</strong> use it, too, to estimate their overtime pay before payday rolls around. Even freelancers and contractors use it to figure out what to charge for longer jobs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHY GO ONLINE?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>An <strong>online Time and a Half Calculator</strong> is easy to use and works anywhere&mdash;phone, tablet, whatever. Enter your numbers, get your results, and you&#39;re done. No need for messy math or complicated formulas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It&#39;s quick, accurate, and helps you follow labor laws. If your workplace racks up a lot of overtime, it&#39;s a real time-saver.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>SEE IT IN ACTION</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Regular hourly rate:</strong> $12<br />\r\n<strong>Time and a half rate:</strong> $18<br />\r\n<strong>Overtime hours:</strong> 5<br />\r\n<strong>Overtime pay:</strong> $90</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Regular hourly rate:</strong> $25<br />\r\n<strong>Time and a half rate:</strong> $37.50<br />\r\n<strong>Overtime hours:</strong> 4<br />\r\n<strong>Overtime pay:</strong> $150</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That&#39;s all there is to it&mdash;just plug in your info and see what you&#39;ve earned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>What&#39;s a Time and a Half Calculator for?</strong><br />\r\n	It figures out overtime pay at <strong>1.5 times</strong> your regular hourly wage.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>When do you get time and a half?</strong><br />\r\n	Usually when you work more than the standard weekly hours, like over <strong>40 hours</strong>.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Is time and a half always required?</strong><br />\r\n	Not everywhere, but many countries have laws that require it. Rules can vary depending on where you work.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Does the calculator work for any hourly wage?</strong><br />\r\n	Yes, just enter your rate and overtime hours. It handles the rest.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Is it accurate for payroll?</strong><br />\r\n	Absolutely. It uses the standard formula to calculate overtime pay.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>REFERENCES</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Overtime+Pay+Regulations+and+Labor+Standards\" target=\"_blank\">Overtime Pay Regulations and Labor Standards</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Payroll+and+Wage+Calculation+Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\">Payroll and Wage Calculation Guidelines</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Workforce+Compensation+Policies\" target=\"_blank\">Workforce Compensation Policies</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Employment+Law+and+Overtime+Rules\" target=\"_blank\">Employment Law and Overtime Rules</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Human+Resource+Payroll+Management+Practices\" target=\"_blank\">Human Resource Payroll Management Practices</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>IN SHORT</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A <strong>Time and a Half Calculator</strong> takes the guesswork out of overtime pay. It saves time, keeps things fair for employees, and streamlines payroll for employers. Just enter your info and let it crunch the numbers&mdash;no more headaches, just accurate pay.</p>'),
(6, 'Empty', 'Time Dilation Calculator', 'Time Dilation Calculator', 'time-dilation-calculator', 'Time Dilation Calculator', 'Empty', 'Empty', 'Time Dilation Calculator', 'Time Dilation Calculator', '{\"tool_desc\":\"Enter the time interval and the speed of light, and the tool will calculate the relative time\",\"feedback_text\":\"Give us your feedback\",\"resl\":\"Result\",\"calc\":\"Calculate\",\"re_calc\":\"Re Calculate\",\"1\":\"Seconds\",\"2\":\"Minutes\",\"3\":\"Hours\",\"4\":\"Days\",\"5\":\"Weeks\",\"6\":\"Months\",\"7\":\"Years\",\"8\":\"Relative Time (\\u0394t\')\",\"9\":\"Relative Time (\\u0394t\') In Other Units\",\"10\":\"Observer Velocity (v)\",\"11\":\"Time Interval (\\u0394t)\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"contact-us\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"content-disc\":\"Content Disclaimer\",\"terms-n-condition\":\"Terms And Conditions\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"footer-desc\":\"Manage your time like a pro! The time calculator is a free online resource that is ready to help                         individuals seeking some assistance to manage their time for planning events and other tasks.\",\"Follow-Us\":\"Follow Us\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"related\":\"Related Tools\",\"rating\":\"Rating & Review\",\"Votes\":\"Votes\",\"feedback-experience\":\"How Was Your Calculator Experience?\",\"email\":\"Email\",\"feedback-msg\":\"How Can We Impove It?\",\"feedback-Close\":\"Close\",\"feedback-Submit\":\"Submit\",\"toc\":\"Table of Content\"}', 'Time Dilation Calculator', 0, '{\"more\":[{\"cal_link\":\"time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-to-decimal\",\"cal_title\":\"Time to Decimal\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-duration-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Duration Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-span-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Span Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedat