(20, 'Empty', 'Average Time Calculator', 'Average Time Calculator', 'average-time-calculator', 'Average Time Calculator', 'Empty', 'Empty', 'Average Time Calculator', 'Use this calculator to determine the average value of multiple time entities and find out how long it takes to complete different activities on average.', '{\"tool_desc\":\"Enter two or more times to find their average with the given tool.  At a time, you can calculate the average up to 20 times.\",\"calc\":\"Calculate\",\"re_calc\":\"Re Calculate\",\"resl\":\"Result\",\"feedback_text\":\"Give us your feedback\",\"time_des\":\"lorim ipsm\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"contact-us\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"content-disc\":\"Content Disclaimer\",\"terms-n-condition\":\"Terms And Conditions\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"footer-desc\":\"Manage your time like a pro! The time calculator is a free online resource that is ready to help                         individuals seeking some assistance to manage their time for planning events and other tasks.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"Follow-Us\":\"Follow Us\",\"rating\":\"Rating & Review\",\"Votes\":\"Votes\",\"feedback-experience\":\"How Was Your Calculator Experience?\",\"email\":\"Email\",\"feedback-msg\":\"How Can We Impove It?\",\"feedback-Close\":\"Close\",\"feedback-Submit\":\"Submit\",\"1\":\"Hours\",\"2\":\"Minutes\",\"3\":\"Seconds\",\"4\":\"Milliseconds\",\"related\":\"Related Tools\",\"toc\":\"Table of Content\"}', 'Average Time Calculator', 0, '{\"0\":\"Time Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-calculator\",\"1\":\"Time to Decimal\\/Empty\\/time-to-decimal\",\"2\":\"Time Duration Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-duration-calculator\",\"3\":\"khali\",\"more\":[{\"cal_link\":\"time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-to-decimal\",\"cal_title\":\"Time to Decimal\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-duration-calculator\",\"cal_title\":