(30, 'Empty', 'Time Card Calculator', 'time card Calculator', 'time-card-calculator', 'Time Card Calculator', 'Empty', 'Empty', 'Free Time Card Calculator', 'Simplify payroll with our free time card calculator that calculates employee hours, overtime, and break deductions for weekly and bi-weekly time cards.', '{\"tool_desc\":\"Prepare the weekly\\/bi-weekly timesheet of an employee by entering the required data in the given tool.\",\"calc\":\"Calculate\",\"re_calc\":\"Re Calculate\",\"resl\":\"Result\",\"feedback_text\":\"Give us your feedback\",\"time_des\":\"lorim ipsm\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"contact-us\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"content-disc\":\"Content Disclaimer\",\"terms-n-condition\":\"Terms And Conditions\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"footer-desc\":\"Manage your time like a pro! The time calculator is a free online resource that is ready to help                         individuals seeking some assistance to manage their time for planning events and other tasks.\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"Follow-Us\":\"Follow Us\",\"rating\":\"Rating & Review\",\"Votes\":\"Hours\",\"feedback-experience\":\"Votes\",\"email\":\"How Was Your Calculator Experience?\",\"feedback-msg\":\"Email\",\"feedback-Close\":\"How Can We Impove It?\",\"feedback-Submit\":\"Close\",\"1\":\"Hour\",\"2\":\"Minutes\",\"3\":\"Seconds\",\"4\":\"Milliseconds\",\"1t\":\"Optional\",\"2t\":\"Start Date\",\"3t\":\"End Date\",\"4t\":\"Name\",\"5t\":\"Timesheet Four\",\"6t\":\"Timesheet Three\",\"7t\":\"Timesheet Two\",\"8t\":\"Advanced Options\",\"9t\":\"Advanced Featurs\",\"10t\":\"Days AND Weeks\",\"11t\":\"Lunch\",\"12t\":\"Overtime And Hour Rate\",\"13t\":\"Sick\",\"14t\":\"Vacation\",\"15t\":\"Week\",\"16t\":\"Timesheet\",\"17t\":\"Days Per Work Week\",\"18t\":\"Day\",\"19t\":\"Days\",\"20t\":\"Name Days\",\"21t\":\"Time Clock Format\",\"22t\":\"Hour Clock\",\"23t\":\"Hourly Rate\",\"24t\":\"No Lunch\",\"25t\":\"Lunch Break\",\"26t\":\"Advanced Lunch Options\",\"27t\":\"Fixed Paid Lunch Breaks\",\"28t\":\"Add min as paid lunch\",\"29t\":\"Overtime\",\"30t\":\"No Overtime\",\"31t\":\"Overtime after\",\"32t\":\"hours\",\"33t\":\"Overtime Pay\",\"34t\":\"Regular Pay\",\"35t\":\"Sick Hours\",\"36t\":\"Vacation Hours\",\"37t\":\"To\",\"38t\":\"Sick Time\",\"39t\":\"Sick Pay\",\"40t\":\"Vacation Hours Pay\",\"41t\":\"Vacation Hours\",\"42t\":\"Duty Time\",\"43t\":\"Overtime\",\"44t\":\"Total Time\",\"45t\":\"Total Pay\",\"46t\":\"In\",\"47t\":\"Out\",\"48t\":\"Weeks Per Timesheet\",\"49t\":\"Week\\/Timesheet\",\"50t\":\"Day\\/Week\",\"51t\":\"Days\\/Week\",\"related\":\"Related Tools\",\"toc\":\"Table of Content\",\"1n\":\"Name:\",\"2n\":\"Date:\",\"3n\":\"Day\",\"4n\":\"Starting Time\",\"5n\":\"Ending Time\",\"6n\":\"Break Deduction\",\"7n\":\"Total\",\"8n\":\"Total Hours\",\"9n\":\"Overtime Pay\",\"10n\":\"Overtime Hours\",\"11n\":\"Total Pay\",\"12n\":\"Base Pay Rate:\",\"13n\":\"Overtime Gross Wage:\",\"14n\":\"hours per day\",\"15n\":\"hours per week\",\"16n\":\"Overtime rate:\",\"17n\":\"Switch to Bi-Weekly\",\"18n\":\"Print\",\"19n\":\"Download\",\"20n\":\"Reset\"}', 'Time Card Calculator', 0, '{\"0\":\"Time Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-calculator\",\"1\":\"Time to Decimal\\/Empty\\/time-to-decimal\",\"2\":\"Time Duration Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-duration-calculator\",\"3\":\"khali\",\"more\":[{\"cal_link\":\"time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-to-decimal\",\"cal_title\":\"Time to Decimal\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-duration-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Duration Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-span-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Span Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-and-a-half-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time and a Half Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-dilation-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Dilation Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"de\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Zeitrechner\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"fr\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calcul Heure\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"es\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tiempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ru\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u041a\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c\\u043a\\u0443\\u043b\\u044f\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440 \\u0412\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ar\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u062d\\u0633\\u0627\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0642\\u062a\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"pt\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ja\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u6642\\u9593\\u8a08\\u7b97\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"}]}', 'Timedate', '0', 1, '', '', 'Calculator', 'Be Happy', 0, 1, 'admin', 'admin', 0, NULL, '1', '<h2>TIME CARD CALCULATOR</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Time Card Calculator Illustration\" src=\"https://api.thetime-calculator.com/images/uploaded_1767903510446.svg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ever spent way too long adding up someone&rsquo;s hours, only to realize you messed up somewhere? That&rsquo;s where a <strong>Time Card Calculator</strong> comes in. It automates the whole process&mdash;tracking clock-ins, clock-outs, breaks, and overtime&mdash;so you get an accurate total every time. <strong>Payroll teams</strong>, HR folks, and managers love it, especially in places with lots of hourly workers or constantly changing schedules.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Crunching the numbers by hand gets old fast and mistakes sneak in easily. With a Time Card Calculator, you just plug in the hours&mdash;when someone started, when they finished, how long their break was&mdash;and it spits out the total, breaks included, overtime calculated, ready to go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHAT IS A TIME CARD CALCULATOR?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Basically, it&rsquo;s an <strong>online tool</strong> that does the math for you. You enter when someone started and ended their shift, add any lunch or breaks, and it figures out the <strong>real hours worked</strong>. It even handles <strong>overtime</strong> if someone stays late. That means payroll is right, and you stay on top of labor law rules.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Say an employee clocks in at 9:00 AM, leaves at 5:00 PM, and takes a 30-minute lunch. The calculator takes out the lunch break and shows they worked 7.5 hours. Simple.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>HOW DOES IT WORK?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Time Card Calculation Example\" src=\"https://api.thetime-calculator.com/images/uploaded_1767903524224.svg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here&rsquo;s the breakdown:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You enter clock-in and clock-out times.</li>\r\n	<li>Add the break duration.</li>\r\n	<li>The calculator subtracts breaks, adds up total hours, and flags any overtime.</li>\r\n	<li>It multiplies hours by pay rate, so you get the total pay.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Clock-in: 8:00 AM</li>\r\n	<li>Clock-out: 5:30 PM</li>\r\n	<li>Break: 1 hour</li>\r\n	<li>Hourly rate: $15</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Total hours: 8.5<br />\r\nOvertime (anything over 8 hours): 0.5<br />\r\nTotal pay: (8 &times; $15) + (0.5 &times; $22.5) = $135</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHY BOTHER WITH A TIME CARD CALCULATOR?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A few reasons:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>No more math errors.</li>\r\n	<li>HR and payroll teams save time&mdash;no more triple-checking calculations.</li>\r\n	<li>Keeps you compliant with labor laws around breaks and overtime.</li>\r\n	<li>Everyone can see exactly how hours and pay add up&mdash;no surprises.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHO USES TIME CARD CALCULATORS?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Any business with hourly workers</strong>&mdash;accuracy matters.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Payroll departments</strong>&mdash;quick and smooth payments.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Shift-based jobs</strong>&mdash;track changing hours and overtime.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Freelancers and contractors</strong>&mdash;makes billing easy.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>BENEFITS OF USING IT ONLINE</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Super easy&mdash;just enter the numbers and you&rsquo;re done.</li>\r\n	<li>Cuts out mistakes from hand-calculated time cards.</li>\r\n	<li>Less admin work.</li>\r\n	<li>Employees trust the numbers&mdash;they can check for themselves.</li>\r\n	<li>Handles different pay rates, multiple shifts, and all sorts of overtime rules.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>EXAMPLES</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Clock-in: 9:00 AM<br />\r\nClock-out: 5:00 PM<br />\r\nBreak: 30 minutes<br />\r\nTotal hours: 7.5</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Clock-in: 7:30 AM<br />\r\nClock-out: 4:45 PM<br />\r\nBreak: 1 hour<br />\r\nTotal hours: 8.25<br />\r\nOvertime: 0.25</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Clock-in: 8:00 AM<br />\r\nClock-out: 6:00 PM<br />\r\nBreak: 1 hour<br />\r\nHourly rate: $20<br />\r\nRegular hours: 8<br />\r\nOvertime: 1<br />\r\nTotal pay: (8 &times; $20) + (1 &times; $30) = $190</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These examples show how the calculator does the heavy lifting, so payroll and records are spot on.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>What does a Time Card Calculator do?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>It totals up hours worked, subtracts breaks, and adds overtime, so payroll is always accurate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Can it handle more than one shift in a day?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, most online calculators let you enter multiple start and end times for split shifts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Does it figure out overtime pay?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, just plug in the rules and your hourly rate&mdash;it&rsquo;ll do the rest.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Can employees check their own hours?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Absolutely. Anyone can enter their times and see the totals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why is this so important?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>You get fewer mistakes, save time, follow labor laws, and everyone knows exactly what they&rsquo;re being paid for.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>REFERENCES</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Payroll+Calculation+Standards+%E2%80%93+Labor+Law+Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\">Payroll Calculation Standards &ndash; Labor Law Guidelines</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Employee+Time+Tracking+Methods+%E2%80%93+Workforce+Management+Research\" target=\"_blank\">Employee Time Tracking Methods &ndash; Workforce Management Research</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Overtime+and+Break+Rules+%E2%80%93+Employment+Law+Resources\" target=\"_blank\">Overtime and Break Rules &ndash; Employment Law Resources</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Timekeeping+Best+Practices+%E2%80%93+HR+and+Payroll+Management\" target=\"_blank\">Timekeeping Best Practices &ndash; HR and Payroll Management</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Work+Hour+Recording+Standards+%E2%80%93+Professional+Business+Guides\" target=\"_blank\">Work Hour Recording Standards &ndash; Professional Business Guides</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>IN SHORT</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A <strong>Time Card Calculator</strong> takes the headache out of tracking work hours and payroll. It&rsquo;s a must-have for businesses, payroll teams, and employees who want speed, accuracy, and transparency. Hourly workers, contractors, freelancers&mdash;anyone can use it to keep things fair, fast, and correct. If you want to stop guessing and start knowing, this tool just makes sense.</p>'),
