u0642\\u062a\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"pt\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ja\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u6642\\u9593\\u8a08\\u7b97\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"}]}', 'Timedate', '0', 1, '', '', 'Calculator', 'Be Happy', 0, 1, 'admin', 'admin', 0, NULL, '1', '<p>Continue some day...</p>'),
(132, 'Empty', 'Sleep Calculator', NULL, 'sleep-calculator', 'Sleep Calculator', 'Empty', 'Empty', 'Sleep Time Calculator: Know Your Ideal Sleep/Wake-Up Time', 'Determine your bedtime and wake-up time with our sleep calculator which calculates the perfect sleep schedule based on your desired wake-up time and recommended sleep duration.', '{\"tool_desc\":\"Calculate your daily bedtime and wake-up time based on the sleep cycle duration with the given tool.\",\"time_des\":\"Blank inputs are considered\",\"1\":\"Bedtime\",\"2\":\"Wake-up Time\",\"3\":\"Total time of breaks\",\"4\":\"Departure time\",\"add_sub_title\":\"add or subtract time from a date\",\"add_sub_title_des\":\"The calculator will help you schedule your plans by adding or subtracting the custom time inputs from a start time & date.\",\"5\":\"It takes about 15 minutes for a normal individual to fall asleep.\",\"6\":\"If you want to wake up at the time you enter, you need to go to bed at the following suggested times.\",\"7\":\"Try waking up at the following suggested times in case you sleep right at the moment.\",\"8\":\"Waking up at one of these mentioned times confirms you complete your sleep cycle of 90 minutes properly.\",\"calc\":\"Calculate\",\"re_calc\":\"Re Calculate\",\"result\":\"Result\",\"10\":\"share this with your friends\",\"12\":\"Copy\",\"13\":\"Date\",\"14\":\"Share Calculator\",\"15\":\"Regular Worktime\",\"16\":\"Overtime\",\"add_sub_title_des2\":\"Blank inputs are considered\",\"tl_time\":\"Total Time\",\"exp_title\":\"Time Calculator in Expression\",\"exp_disc\":\"The following calculator lets you input times as expressions and adds or subtracts according to the operator you select.\",\"exp_disc2\":\"(Valid Expression: 4d+7h-2m+1s)\",\"toc\":\"Table of Content\",\"feedback_text\":\"Give us your feedback\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"about\":\"About\",\"contact-us\":\"Contact Us\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"content-disc\":\"Content Disclaimer\",\"terms-n-condition\":\"Terms And Conditions\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"footer-desc\":\"Manage your time like a pro! The time calculator is a free online resource that is ready to help individuals seeking some assistance to manage their time for planning events and other tasks.\",\"Follow-Us\":\"Follow Us\",\"Explore\":\"Explore\",\"related\":\"Related Tools\",\"rating\":\"Rating & Review\",\"Votes\":\"Votes\",\"feedback-experience\":\"How Was Your Calculator Experience?\",\"email\":\"Email\",\"feedback-msg\":\"How Can We Impove It?\",\"feedback-Close\":\"Close\",\"feedback-Submit\":\"Submit\",\"17\":\"week\",\"18\":\"Month\",\"19\":\"hours\",\"20\":\"days\",\"21\":\"weeks\",\"22\":\"hour\",\"23\":\"day\",\"24\":\"hour\",\"25\":\"month\",\"26\":\"week\",\"27\":\"day\",\"28\":\"Time of Flight\",\"29\":\"Per Hour\",\"30\":\"Initial Horizontal Velocity\",\"31\":\"Gravitational Acceleration\",\"32\":\"Arrival time\",\"33\":\"Regular pay\",\"34\":\"Overtime Pay\",\"35\":\"Per\",\"36\":\"Total Regular pay\",\"37\":\"Week\",\"38\":\"Month\",\"39\":\"Year\",\"41\":\"Initial Vertical Velocity\",\"9\":\"Remember you must complete 5-6 sleep cycles to wake up refreshed and energized.\",\"42\":\"Suggested\",\"43\":\"ok\",\"44\":\"I want to\",\"45\":\"wake up at\",\"46\":\"go to bed at\",\"47\":\"Now\",\"48\":\"minutes late\",\"49\":\"hour later\",\"50\":\"I want to sleep for\",\"51\":\"If you wake up at\",\"52\":\"you are suggested go to bed at one of he following times to stay active\",\"53\":\"sleep cycles\",\"54\":\"You can choose one of the following times in case you have various arrangements\",\"55\":\"If you sleep at\",\"56\":\"you are suggested to wake up at one of he following times to stay active\",\"57\":\"You should go to bed at\",\"58\":\"You should wake up at\",\"59\":\"Sleep Calculator\",\"60\":\"Sleep Length Calculator\"}', 'Sleep Calculator', 0, '{\"0\":\"Time Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-calculator\",\"1\":\"Time to Decimal\\/Empty\\/time-to-decimal\",\"2\":\"Time Duration Calculator\\/Empty\\/time-duration-calculator\",\"3\":\"khali\",\"more\":[{\"cal_link\":\"time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-to-decimal\",\"cal_title\":\"Time to Decimal\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-duration-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Duration Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-span-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Span Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-and-a-half-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time and a Half Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"time-dilation-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Time Dilation Calculator\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"de\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Zeitrechner\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"fr\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calcul Heure\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"es\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tiempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ru\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u041a\\u0430\\u043b\\u044c\\u043a\\u0443\\u043b\\u044f\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440 \\u0412\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ar\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u062d\\u0633\\u0627\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0648\\u0642\\u062a\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"pt\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"Calculadora de Tempo\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"},{\"cal_link\":\"ja\\/time-calculator\",\"cal_title\":\"\\u6642\\u9593\\u8a08\\u7b97\",\"cal_cat\":\"Timedate\",\"no_index\":\"0\"}]}', 'Timedate', '0', 1, '', '', 'Calculator', 'Be Happy', 0, 1, 'admin', 'admin', 0, NULL, '1', '<h2>SLEEP CALCULATOR</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Sleep Calculator Illustration\" src=\"https://api.thetime-calculator.com/images/uploaded_1767903317074.svg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A <strong>Sleep Calculator</strong> is a handy tool that takes the guesswork out of finding the best sleep schedule. Instead of just hoping you&rsquo;ll wake up feeling rested, this tool figures out the ideal times to go to bed or get up, all based on natural <strong>sleep cycles</strong>. It&rsquo;s a lifesaver for anyone&mdash;students, night-shift workers, busy professionals, or just folks trying to feel better in the morning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Trying to plan your sleep on your own gets tricky fast. <strong>Sleep cycles</strong> usually last about <strong>90 minutes</strong>, and if you wake up in the middle of one, you&rsquo;ll probably feel groggy. The Sleep Calculator sorts all that out for you. Just plug in your bedtime or when you want to wake up, and it suggests the right times to make sure you catch the end of a cycle&mdash;so you&rsquo;re more likely to wake up refreshed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHAT IS A SLEEP CALCULATOR?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Think of a <strong>Sleep Calculator</strong> as your online sleep planner. It works out when you should go to bed or set your alarm, all based on a few key things:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The average <strong>sleep cycle</strong> (about 90 minutes)</li>\r\n	<li>How much sleep adults need (usually 7 to 9 hours)</li>\r\n	<li>How long it takes you to fall asleep (about 10&ndash;15 minutes)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>So, let&rsquo;s say you want to wake up at 6:30 AM. The calculator might tell you to go to bed at 9:00 PM, 10:30 PM, or even midnight. That way, you&rsquo;re not yanked out of deep sleep by your alarm.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>HOW THE SLEEP CALCULATOR WORKS</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Sleep Cycle Illustration\" src=\"https://api.thetime-calculator.com/images/uploaded_1767903334983.svg\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Using the Sleep Calculator is simple:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You pick your ideal wake-up time or when you want to go to bed.</li>\r\n	<li>It calculates your sleep cycles&mdash;about 90 minutes each.</li>\r\n	<li>It adds in the time it takes you to fall asleep (usually 10&ndash;15 minutes).</li>\r\n	<li>It spits out the best times to wake up or go to bed, so you finish a sleep cycle, not interrupt one.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Some calculators let you get fancy&mdash;add naps, work around shift schedules, or even use data from your fitness tracker for a more personal touch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHY USE A SLEEP CALCULATOR?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>There&rsquo;s a bunch of reasons to use one:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You&rsquo;ll probably wake up less groggy since you&rsquo;re not interrupting deep sleep.</li>\r\n	<li>Better sleep means sharper thinking, more energy, and higher productivity.</li>\r\n	<li>Good sleep helps your body fight off health problems and boosts your mood.</li>\r\n	<li>You can plan your sleep around your life, not the other way around.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>COMMON USES OF A SLEEP CALCULATOR</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Shift Workers</strong>: Adjust sleep for night shifts or odd hours.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Students</strong>: Work sleep around late-night studying or early classes.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Professionals</strong>: Get enough rest to stay focused and creative.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Travelers</strong>: Tweak your sleep to beat jet lag in new time zones.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Parents</strong>: Set up steady sleep routines for kids.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>BENEFITS OF USING AN ONLINE SLEEP CALCULATOR</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>It&rsquo;s accurate&mdash;built on real sleep science.</li>\r\n	<li>Easy to use. Just enter your info and get instant results.</li>\r\n	<li>You can customize it for naps, bedtime routines, or wake-up times.</li>\r\n	<li>Helps you build better sleep habits and feel more energized.</li>\r\n	<li>Saves time. No more guessing when to hit the hay.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>SLEEP CALCULATION EXAMPLES</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Want to get up at 7:00 AM? The calculator suggests bedtime at 9:00 PM, 10:30 PM, or midnight. You wake up at the end of a full sleep cycle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Going to bed at 11:00 PM? Try waking up at 6:00 AM, 7:30 AM, or 9:00 AM.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need a nap? Keep it to about 20&ndash;30 minutes to avoid feeling groggy after.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ)</h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>What&rsquo;s a Sleep Calculator for?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>It helps you figure out when to sleep and wake up so you get better rest and more energy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Can it really improve sleep quality?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes. Waking up at the right point in your sleep cycle makes a huge difference in how you feel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Is it accurate?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Absolutely. It&rsquo;s based on solid sleep science and research.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Does it work for weird schedules or night shifts?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, it can adjust for shift work, naps, or changing routines.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why bother finding the &ldquo;right&rdquo; sleep time?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Getting your sleep right keeps your brain sharp, your body healthy, your mood steady, and your productivity up.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>REFERENCES</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=National+Sleep+Foundation+%E2%80%93+Sleep+Cycle+Research+and+Guidelines\" target=\"_blank\">National Sleep Foundation &ndash; Sleep Cycle Research and Guidelines</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Sleep+Science+Studies+%E2%80%93+Journals+on+Circadian+Rhythms+and+Rest\" target=\"_blank\">Sleep Science Studies &ndash; Journals on Circadian Rhythms and Rest</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Time+Management+and+Productivity+%E2%80%93+Professional+Sleep+and+Wellness+Resources\" target=\"_blank\">Time Management and Productivity &ndash; Professional Sleep and Wellness Resources</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Sleep+Quality+and+Health+%E2%80%93+Medical+Research+Articles\" target=\"_blank\">Sleep Quality and Health &ndash; Medical Research Articles</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Optimal+Sleep+Duration+%E2%80%93+Global+Health+and+Sleep+Recommendations\" target=\"_blank\">Optimal Sleep Duration &ndash; Global Health and Sleep Recommendations</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>FINAL SUMMARY</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A <strong>Sleep Calculator</strong> makes it easier to get the rest you need. It figures out the best times to go to bed or wake up, based on how your body naturally sleeps. Whether you&rsquo;re a student, a parent, a shift worker, or anyone who wants to feel less tired, this tool helps you build a better sleep routine&mdash;so you wake up ready to tackle the day.</p>');
