(147, 'Empty', 'Máy Tính Thời Gian Trung Bình', NULL, 'vi/average-time-calculator', 'Average Time Calculator', 'Empty', 'Empty', 'Máy Tính Thời Gian Trung Bình', 'Sử dụng máy tính này để xác định giá trị trung bình của nhiều thực thể thời gian và tìm hiểu thời gian trung bình để hoàn thành các hoạt động khác nhau.', '{\"1\":\"Gi\\u1edd\",\"2\":\"Ph\\u00fat\",\"3\":\"Gi\\u00e2y\",\"4\":\"Mili gi\\u00e2y\",\"tool_desc\":\"Nh\\u1eadp hai ho\\u1eb7c nhi\\u1ec1u th\\u1eddi gian \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00ecm gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung b\\u00ecnh c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c cung c\\u1ea5p. T\\u1ea1i m\\u1ed9t th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 t\\u00ednh gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung b\\u00ecnh l\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ebfn 20 l\\u1ea7n.\",\"calc\":\"T\\u00ednh to\\u00e1n\",\"re_calc\":\"T\\u00ednh l\\u1ea1i\",\"resl\":\"K\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3\",\"feedback_text\":\"G\\u1eedi ph\\u1ea3n h\\u1ed3i cho ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i\",\"time_des\":\"lorim ipsm\",\"home\":\"Nh\\u00e0\",\"about\":\"V\\u1ec1\",\"contact-us\":\"S\\u1ef1 ti\\u1ebfp x\\u00fac\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"content-disc\":\"Tuy\\u00ean B\\u1ed1 Mi\\u1ec5n Tr\\u1eeb N\\u1ed9i Dung\",\"terms-n-condition\":\"\\u0110i\\u1ec1u Kho\\u1ea3n V\\u00e0 \\u0110i\\u1ec1u Ki\\u1ec7n\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Ch\\u00ednh S\\u00e1ch B\\u1ea3o M\\u1eadt\",\"footer-desc\":\"Qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd th\\u1eddi gian c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t chuy\\u00ean gia! M\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh th\\u1eddi gian l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t ngu\\u1ed3n t\\u00e0i nguy\\u00ean tr\\u1ef1c tuy\\u1ebfn mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed, s\\u1eb5n s\\u00e0ng gi\\u00fap nh\\u1eefng c\\u00e1 nh\\u00e2n \\u0111ang t\\u00ecm ki\\u1ebfm s\\u1ef1 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 \\u0111\\u1ec3 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd th\\u1eddi gian l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch s\\u1ef1 ki\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c nhi\\u1ec7m v\\u1ee5 kh\\u00e1c.\",\"Explore\":\"Kh\\u00e1m ph\\u00e1\",\"Follow-Us\":\"Theo d\\u00f5i ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i\",\"rating\":\"X\\u1e